[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      198[0m:[38;5;10m[49m injecting 30 deliberate bugs into `translation/src/lib.rs`, rebuilding, and
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      199[0m:[38;5;10m[49m re-running. Results:
