[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      205[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `bucket->index = i-1`, `final_index`, `temp = 1` on a successful delete,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      206[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   the `hmget_key_ts` bootstrap sentinel, `(unsigned char) mode` truncation,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      207[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `shmode_func`'s initial length, `hmput_default`'s zeroing, the arena block
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      208[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   saturation and splice order, `stralloc`'s pointer arithmetic, `strkey`'s
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      209[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   format string, the seed-advance constants, siphash's round counts, the
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      210[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `stbds_temp_key` second-probe-loop quirk, the `mode == 1` exact tests in
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      211[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   `hmdel_key`, and `hmfree_func`'s loop start index.
